  "steps": [
    "Blind bake the pie crust according to the package and let it cool.",
    "Beat the cream cheese, ricotta, heavy cream, powdered sugar, vanilla, orange zest, and cinnamon until light and fluffy, 4-5 minutes. Fold in the mini chocolate chips.",
    "Fill the cooled crust and chill at least 2 hours (or 45 minutes in the freezer).",
    "Make the ganache: microwave the chocolate chips and 3 tbsp cream at 50% power for 45 seconds, then in 15-second bursts, stirring, until smooth. Pour over the chilled filling and chill 1-2 hours to set.",
    "Whip the 1 1/2 cups cream to soft peaks, add the powdered sugar, and beat to stiff peaks. Pipe onto the pie and top with mini chips, cannolis, and pistachios."
  ]
